    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_LULLABY_OF_CERIDWEN_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]Can train the Lutist (national unit, 2).[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Lullaby, its battle hex, cast with its first spell action: each enemy unit in the enemy's rearmost row in use (the middle row of an army of two rows) skips its next action.",
